2. Effort Metrics (derived using interaction):
   - e_per_branch = e / branchCount (effort per branch).
3. Cyclomatic Density: 
   - v(g)_density = v(g) / loc (existing) and ev(g)_density = ev(g) / loc (essential complexity per line of code).

